{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>HabitSet 是一款以彩色方格追蹤每日習慣的工具，適合想建立運動、閱讀、飲水、冥想等規律，或戒除壞習慣的人。它讓你設定目標、查看進度，並以私密方式保存在裝置內；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-55.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>彩色方格習慣追蹤</h2>\n<p>HabitSet 以彩色方格儀錶板呈現每日習慣進度，完成一天即填滿一格，形成直觀的視覺鏈條，適合想持續運動、閱讀、飲水或戒除壞習慣的人。新增習慣可設定名稱、描述、圖示與顏色；日曆可補登或取消完成紀錄，亦可封存習慣並隨時還原。程式支援匯出及匯入資料，資料只留在裝置，無需登入或帳戶。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-53-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-54-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-55-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-56-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-57-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：HabitSet: Habit Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/habitset-habit-tracker/id6761116529?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T20:20:50.468365+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":316,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T20:01:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T20:18:33.496260+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T20:18:33.496260+00:00","content_hash":"734413accf5277ef7ac2694a80dc527bf27eadb4cc8adac8070d5b8b9d5ecb49","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}